{"id":"wb-1-77","name":"义慈惠石柱","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"义慈惠石柱","text":"义慈惠石柱，位于中华人民共和国河北省保定市定兴县石柱村，始建于北齐，是纪念镇压葛荣起义的纪念柱。该石柱为石灰岩材质，通高7米，分为柱身和石屋两部分，柱身上刻有4000余字的铭文，记载了建柱的缘由和相关人物。1961年，义慈惠石柱被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%89%E6%85%88%E6%83%A0%E7%9F%B3%E6%9F%B1","revisionId":94224345,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94224345","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b6ac7df4af70d67783d678aa.jpg","title":"义慈惠石柱.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%89%E6%85%88%E6%83%A0%E7%9F%B3%E6%9F%B1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/%E4%B9%89%E6%85%88%E6%83%A0%E7%9F%B3%E6%9F%B1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Redpipe","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNHE-312-024","width":320,"height":481,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}